[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0126","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0126.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-8787","title":"WordPress Firebase Support & Chat Management 插件权限提升漏洞","description":"WordPress Firebase Support & Chat Management 插件（版本 ≤ 3.1.1）中存在权限提升漏洞。该插件在 `firebase_auth()` 函数处理认证请求时，仅通过 `user_email` POST 参数获取邮箱地址即登录对应用户，但未验证 Firebase ID 令牌的签名、签发方和受众等关键信息，导致攻击者无需持有目标用户的 Firebase 身份凭证即可伪装认证。已认证的攻击者（拥有订阅者及以上权限）可向 `acb_firebase_auth` AJAX 接口提交任意已存在用户的邮箱地址，从而实现账户接管，包括管理员账户。CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-8787"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-05-27T07:16:15.060","updated":"2026-06-17T11:04:28.310","remediation":"立即升级 WordPress Firebase Support & Chat Management 插件至 3.1.1 以上版本。检查 `acb_firebase_auth` AJAX 函数中对 Firebase ID Token 的签名、颁发者、受众验证逻辑是否完整，确保 `user_email` 参数不可直接用于身份认证。如无法升级，临时禁用该 AJAX 动作或移除 `firebase_auth()` 函数中的邮箱直传逻辑作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/browser/admin-chat-box/tags/3.1.1/inc/ACB_AjaxHandler.php#L237","https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/browser/admin-chat-box/tags/3.1.1/inc/ACB_AjaxHandler.php#L338","https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/browser/admin-chat-box/trunk/inc/ACB_AjaxHandler.php#L237","https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/browser/admin-chat-box/trunk/inc/ACB_AjaxHandler.php#L338","https://www.wordfence.com/threat-intel/vulnerabilities/id/90783d75-a255-4133-ac7b-32e0a70c8c69?source=cve","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e8c9e9f5b27488fcb1deabf0d655d9ceb258cbfc/cves/2026/8xxx/CVE-2026-8787.json","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/f26250516f87314d5f3abfa090d804e53cf54f53/nuclei-templates/2026/CVE-2026-8787-admin_chat_box-90783d75-a255-4133-ac7b-32e0a70c8c69.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1d40439944a245bd3d15d0e2034784cb651a6b55/2026/8xxx/CVE-2026-8787.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/644985d2f6944ebfc351d3a58af338c527c434cf/content/posts/cve-2026-8787.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2026-8787.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f5ee58102af366026efb2988554e99ff8cc7a609/advisories/unreviewed/2026/05/GHSA-g86w-5353-83r2/GHSA-g86w-5353-83r2.json","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/WordPress_Firebase_Support_and_Chat_Management_%E6%8F%92%E4%BB%B6%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E_CVE-2026-8787.toml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2026-8787-admin_chat_box-90783d75-a255-4133-ac7b-32e0a70c8c69.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6964f0764748f6ac1325f430341f6b56fd263013/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-8787.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-8787.json","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-8787"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0126.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0081","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0081.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-4480","title":"Samba 打印子系统远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Samba 打印子系统中存在操作系统命令注入漏洞。在配置了 print command 参数时，Samba 将客户端可控的打印作业描述（job description）字符串通过 %J 替换符传递给 shell 命令，而未对 shell 元字符进行转义过滤。远程未经身份认证的攻击者可通过提交特制的打印作业描述，在目标服务器上以 root 权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Samba 4.20.2 之前版本，CVSS 评分 9.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-4480"],"sources":["cve","hwpoc"],"published":"2026-05-26","updated":"2026-07-15","remediation":"立即升级至 Samba 4.20.2 及以上版本，该版本已修复 %J 参数未转义 shell 元字符的问题。如无法立即升级，可在 smb.conf 中禁用打印服务（load printers = no、printing = bsd），或在防火墙层面限制 445/tcp 端口的访问来源。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:22644","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:22963","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:25049","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:25979","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:28053","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:28054","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:28055","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:28056","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:28057","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:28058","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:28132","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-4480","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2452232","https://bugzilla.samba.org/show_bug.cgi?id=16033","https://security.access.redhat.com/data/csaf/v2/vex/2026/cve-2026-4480.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/javascript/cves/2026/CVE-2026-4480.yaml","https://github.com/Vusal777/CVE-2026-4480-exploit-poc","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f2737ed54bc77e69eee49ea0fc8ad75416232e93/2026/CVE-2026-4480.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/47b5b37845c422b41f7f77baee4751638de71f26/javascript/cves/2026/CVE-2026-4480.yaml","https://github.com/Threekiii/CVE/blob/4e96ec5c1f919e7ddf89ce2335ced09b058e2b49/2026.05/CVE-2026-4480%EF%BC%9ASamba%20%E6%89%93%E5%8D%B0%E5%AD%90%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E.md","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/df044812b70860d79ecaa4ed9deebd528d9595d4/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-4480.md","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2026-4480_6.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/aac9f724534c8b70ef764b55a2e686a2db6290f7/cves/2026/4xxx/CVE-2026-4480.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/mitre/CVE-2026-4480","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/39b22452fe579e54bd7f5c66d1416f8c94c190d0/content/posts/cve-2026-4480.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/8c8fc2aa7ae119f7163aab3170ab59022c4e4e32/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-4480.json","https://github.com/samba-team/samba/blob/7c7b18a2dfbb319358feb5a89b071bf196257793/source3/printing/print_generic.c","https://github.com/TheCyberGeek/CVE-2026-4480-PoC","https://github.com/robinxiang/CVE-2026-4480","https://github.com/CarlosEduardoPM/CVE-2026-4480-POC","https://github.com/0xBlackash/CVE-2026-4480","https://github.com/ClearLotus-git/CVE-2026-4480-PoC","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-4480"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0081.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0083","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0083.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-46300","title":"Linux Linux Kernel 内存碎片化本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Linux 内核网络子系统 skbuff 中的 skb_try_coalesce() 函数在执行 frag 合并时未正确传递 SKBFL_SHARED_FRAG 标记，导致后续 ESP 输入处理误判 skb 的共享 frag 状态，可能在页缓存支持的 frag 上执行就地解密，造成内存写越界。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞实现权限提升，影响 Linux 内核版本低于 6.12.15 的系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-46300"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-05-23T12:17:02.660","updated":"2026-07-15T02:22:13.937","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.12.15 或更高版本（该版本已合入补丁 `net: skbuff: preserve shared-frag marker during coalescing`）。无法立即升级时，可通过 `sysctl -w net.core.rmem_default=262144` 等参数调优 TCP 接收缓冲区缓解风险，或在不需要 ESP（IPsec）功能的系统上卸载相关内核模块以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2f2b16022a2e10ca7bccfb98db5ed2ec0f72641c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3599e6b3cc1ada96883d496a50a210d3afbb6987","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3884358a9286b17f389a72b1426fc4547c23c111","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3bd9e113d50034db99d7ef69fd8e5242d15e414a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/760e1addc27ba1a7beb4a0a7e8b3e9ec49e7a34e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/78bf6b6bb19541d19fbda6242e7cfe2c682763c0","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9d3e5fd19fe1063bf607219e8562fbd567b8e8d5","https://