/Fragnesia-go","https://github.com/cumakurt/linuxpi","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-46300"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0083.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0082","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0082.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-45659","title":"Microsoft SharePoint 反序列化远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft SharePoint Server 存在不受信任数据反序列化漏洞（CWE-502），经过身份认证的攻击者可通过网络向目标 SharePoint 端点发送特制的反序列化 payload（可利用 ysoserial.net 等工具生成），触发漏洞后导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Microsoft SharePoint Enterprise Server 2016、SharePoint Server 2019 及 SharePoint Server Subscription Edition，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高危。该漏洞已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录，Microsoft 已在 2026 年 6 月安全更新中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-45659"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-05-22T23:16:56.273","updated":"2026-07-02T12:16:47.143","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 2026 年对应月份 SharePoint 安全更新（参阅 MSRC 公告），该更新将修复 SharePoint 中的反序列化漏洞。如无法立即打补丁，可在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层配置规则拦截包含 ysoserial.net 特征的反序列化攻击载荷，并限制经身份验证用户上传包含序列化数据的文件类型。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-45659","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2026-45659","https://github.com/amnsecurity/CVE-2026-45659-SharePoint-RCE","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f2737ed54bc77e69eee49ea0fc8ad75416232e93/2026/CVE-2026-45659.json","https://github.com/rxerium/rxerium-templates/blob/9027e3321654e19a5cae31a7fc9917246eccd3fb/2026/CVE-2026-45659.yaml","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/df044812b70860d79ecaa4ed9deebd528d9595d4/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-45659.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/aac9f724534c8b70ef764b55a2e686a2db6290f7/cves/2026/45xxx/CVE-2026-45659.json","https://github.com/mthcht/ThreatIntel-Reports/blob/0c2473c24dfecb383fdaacf2e465a9c66649856e/Intel%20Reports/thehackernews_com/2026_07_sharepoint-rce-cve-2026-45659-added-to_html/link.md","https://github.com/XiaomingX/data-cve-poc-py-v1/blob/2384dcccef665cfd62dafa8a075b204cad1f98e9/2026/CVE-2026-45659/README.md","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2026-45659","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/23e59fd10f7619445bb3ab1ba838f2e531989c40/content/posts/cve-2026-45659.md","https://github.com/HORKimhab/CVE-2026-45659/blob/6fea1b6441285abe425b0db173c133cc60c6900f/cve-2026-45659.py","https://github.com/Fu-LLC/CyberFlipper/blob/907c81a4f062e8b8f58fe15af95dc6e69992e64c/badusb/CVE_Daily/2026-07-01/CVE-2026-45659_WINDOWS.txt","https://github.com/HORKimhab/CVE-2026-45659","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-45659"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0082.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0082.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0090","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0090.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-48207","title":"Apache Fory PyFory ReduceSerializer 反序列化漏洞","description":"Apache Fory 的 PyFory 组件 ReduceSerializer 存在反序列化安全漏洞，在处理 reduce-state 恢复和全局名称解析时绕过 DeserializationPolicy 验证钩子。攻击者可通过向使用 PyFory Python-native 模式且关闭 strict mode 的应用发送特制反序列化数据，绕过策略限制加载不安全类或函数，导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Apache Fory 1.0.0 之前版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-48207"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-05-21T17:16:21.857","updated":"2026-06-17T10:54:55.450","remediation":"升级 Apache Fory 至 1.0.0 及以上版本，该版本在 ReduceSerializer 路径中强制实施 DeserializationPolicy 校验。如无法立即升级，确保启用 strict mode（禁用 Python-native 模式）作为临时缓解措施，避免在反序列化中处理不受信数据。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://fory.apache.org/security/#cve-2026-48207-pyfory-reduceserializer-deserializationpolicy-bypass","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/05/21/10","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c8f1603cb76d37d7aca26a74458e0aff33b0985a/cves/2026/48xxx/CVE-2026-48207.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-05-21/TIER_3_CVE-2026-48207.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/ccf2cc3d762789b06638ba5aa3e06982a53080c8/pypi/pyfory/CVE-2026-48207.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/b49e13cf2d645af804096640daf5e00cefbce237/2026/48xxx/CVE-2026-48207.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/23e59fd10f7619445bb3ab1ba838f2e531989c40/content/posts/cve-2026-48207.md","https://github.com/Gatos90/security-llm-wiki/blob/c8d27f1e6ab2ce6bff111d2104bb306d7ef1bcb5/advisories/cve/CVE-2026-48207.md","https://github.com/apache/security-site/blob/688b49dd77e12d8bea3c3d690f69122f8f07c16a/static/projects/fory/CVE-2026-48207.osv.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/0ebf8eac5e6d2af2400b71f0ba35608811c9cff6/references/CVE-2026-48207-2026-06-22-1705","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/Apache_Fory_PyFory_ReduceSerializer_%E5%8F%8D%E5%BA%8F%E5%88%97%E5%8C%96%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E_CVE-2026-48207.toml","https://github.com/stevologic/security-recipes.ai/blob/a86c52bc05315e867dabbf4b089f7ed1e7a5e4aa/content/recipes/cve/cve-2026-48207-apache-fory-pyfory-deserialization-of-untrusted-data.md","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-48207"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0090.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0168","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0168.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-9082","title":"Drupal Core PostgreSQL SQL注入漏洞","description":"Drupal Core 的 PostgreSQL 数据库驱动模块中存在 SQL 注入漏洞，由于对用户输入的特殊元素未进行正确的中和过滤，导致攻击者可在无需认证的情况下通过构造恶意 SQL 语句注入数据库查询，实现信息窃取、数据篡改甚至远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Drupal Core 8.9.0 至 11.3.10 之间的多个版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击者利用该漏洞无需用户交互，仅需向受影响系统发送特制请求即可触发。Drupal 官方已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-9082"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-05-20T20:16:41.230","updated":"2026-06-17T11:04:48.250","remediation":"立即升级 Drupal 核心至以下修复版本：10.4.10、10.5.10、10.6.9、11.1.10、11.2.12 或 11.3.10（取决于当前使用的分支）。同时建议对 PostgreSQL 数据库连接启用最小权限原则，并开启 Drupal 的查询参数化预处理功能。如无法立即升级，可在数据库层面配置 pg_stat_statements 监控异常 SQL 查询。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.drupal.org/sa-core-2026-004","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2026-9082","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/52608","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2026/CVE-2026-9082.yaml","https://github.com/thinhap/CVE-2026-9082-PoC","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/a787519a95f62cf00a76124a68ca5cfb2e26b6ec/2026/CVE-2026-9082.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/9426659ffb94439885c8f9a7072893bb232e3620/http/cves/2026/CVE-2026-9082.yaml","https://github.com/SourByte05/Vulnerability-Wiki-PoC/blob/e52a2c3eaf2fb0befc721cf0919d07ea435a23b4/2026/06/Drupal-CVE-2026-9082-sql%E6%B3%A8%E5%85%A5/Drupal-CVE-2026-9082-sql%E6%B3%A8%E5%85%A5.md","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/df044812b70860d79ecaa4ed9deebd528d9595d4/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-9082.md","https://github.com/7h30th3r0n3/CVE-2026-9082-Drupal-PoC/blob/8b2a4499cdf1a0ed1da14499ae1baf06bcabcddd/CVE-2026-9082.py","https://github.com/crowdsecurity/hub/blob/9c43ebfe5fc7139bd09b5d01c99b1e7e4a2b98a1/appsec-rules/crowdsecurity/vpatch-CVE-2026-9082.yaml","https://github.com/cloudflare/cloudflare-docs/blob/83879d08c2f585144b422608ddded5791c854432/src/content/changelog/waf/2026-06-09-waf-release.mdx","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e8c9e9f5b27488fcb1deabf0d655d9ceb258cbfc/cves/2026/9xxx/CVE-2026-9082.json","https://github.com/XiaomingX/data-cve-poc-py-v1/blob/2384dcccef665cfd62dafa8a075b204cad1f98e9/2026/CVE-2026-9082/drupal-CVE-2026-9082.py","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/fd89cc2cfe78c9fb7c61a5f098d9b2b1a90af9eb/plugins/drupal/drupal/CVE-2026-9082.yaml","https://github.com/7h30th3r0n3/CVE-2026-9082-Drupal-PoC","https://github.com/ambionics/cve-2026-9082-drupal-postgresql-rce","https://github.com/N45HT/drupal-cve-2026-9082-checker","https://github.com/HORKimhab/CVE-2026-9082","https://github.com/0xBlackash/CVE-2026-9082","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-9082"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0168.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0061","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0061.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-23734","title":"XWiki XWiki Platform 路径遍历漏洞","description":"XWiki 平台 ssx 和 jsx 端点存在路径遍历漏洞（CWE-23），远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过构造带有前导斜杠的 resource 参数，利用路径穿越读取 WEB-INF/xwiki.cfg 等敏感配置文件，获取数据库凭证等关键信息可进一步导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 XWiki 16.10.17 以下、17.4.9 以下、17.10.3 以下及 18.1.0-rc-1 以下版本，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-23734"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-05-20T20:16:36.027","updated":"2026-06-17T10:22:01.020","remediation":"立即升级 XWiki 至 18.1.0-rc-1、17.10.3、17.4.9 或 16.10.17 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，在反向代理层（如 Nginx/Apache）配置规则拦截访问 /bin/ssx/ 和 /bin/jsx/ 路径的 resource 参数含 /../ 或前导斜杠的请求，或通过防火墙限制对 XWiki 管理端口的访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/xwiki/xwiki-commons/commit/a979cafd89f6a9c9c0b9ab19744d672df64429bf","https://github.com/xwiki/xwiki-commons/security/advisories/GHSA-xq3r-2qv5-vqqm","https://jira.xwiki.org/browse/XCOMMONS-3547","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cb31df1745cb795b327f3818ad29a4b3cf1cd125/cves/2026/23xxx/CVE-2026-23734.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/fa30538a41a7f2860cb7778b721229e52f8c6dd2/2026/23xxx/CVE-2026-23734.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d4