ftware Center 下载对应版本安装包执行就地升级。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://sec.cloudapps.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-csw-pnbsa-g8WEnuy","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/7f6823bc066973da81d3ae0684f0bccdfe7fa7a4/2026/CVE-2026-20223.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/0d273a0b2821f58c8dfa9e9b4a2ad049f300e8ec/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-20223.md","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-05-20/TIER_2_CVE-2026-20223.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/bb6223196139bc0688b84a1421e9ebaaf1270e61/2026/CVE-2026-20223.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2026/CVE-2026-20223/poc.py","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2026-20223","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/278bea3f9397da219bb29098ecf3912d7bfe0645/content/posts/cve-2026-20223.md","https://github.com/Vu1nT0tal/yarb/blob/2853b83f9525211a3c7c25f2ab4e006505d500ad/archive/2026/2026-05-22.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/664cbcfd536cb5b218ad44ed120fbb123053c091/cve/CVE-2026-20223.html","https://github.com/OwlsNightCatch/ctipilot/blob/17877868f70606505cf71cffc2ec7a24640f7d8e/entries/2026-05-22/cve-2026-20223-cisco-secure-workload-cvss-10-0-zero-auth-res.md","https://github.com/HORKimhab/CVE-2026-20223","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-20223"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0059.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0059.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0059.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0085","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0085.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-46333","title":"Linux Linux Kernel ptrace 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 ptrace 子系统中的 get_dumpable() 逻辑存在权限管理缺陷。ptrace_may_access() 在对没有内存描述符（mm）的线程（如内核线程）进行访问检查时，错误地使用了本应用于判断进程是否可 core dump 的 dumpable 标志，且传统的 capability 丢弃机制无法阻止该检查。本地攻击者可利用此缺陷绕过权限验证，获取内核线程的敏感信息或实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核版本，Linux 社区已在 6.12.13、6.18.22、6.19.12 及更高版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-46333"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-05-15T14:16:35.793","updated":"2026-07-15T02:22:15.687","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至安全版本：稳定版升级到 6.12.13 及以上，长期支持版升级到 6.18.22 及以上，最新主线版升级到 6.19.12 及以上。可通过 `uname -r` 确认当前版本，使用发行版包管理器（如 `apt upgrade`、`yum update`）获取更新。如无法立即升级，可临时限制非 root 用户对 ptrace 的访问：通过内核参数 `kernel.yama.ptrace_scope = 1` 写入 `/etc/sysctl.conf` 并执行 `sysctl -p` 生效，阻止非授权进程间调试。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/01363cb3fbd0238ffdeb09f53e9039c9edf8a730","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/15b828a46f305ae9f05a7c16914b3ce273474205","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2a93a4fac7b6051d3be7cd1b015fe7320cd0404d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/31e62c2ebbfdc3fe3dbdf5e02c92a9dc67087a3a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4709234fd1b95136ceb789f639b1e7ea5de1b181","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6e5b51e74a40d377bcd3081dd33fbaa0e1aa7e3d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8f907d345bae8f4b3f004c5abc56bf2dfb851ea7","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/93d4ba49d18e3d7fb41a9927c2d0cca5e9dfefd6","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/05/15/9","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/05/20/14","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/05/20/16","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2026/05/msg00032.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2026/05/msg00035.html","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:19521","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:19540","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:19568","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:19569","https://access.r