s/articles/40437020299927-Security-CVE-2026-29205-cPanel-WHM-WP2-Security-Update-May-13-2026","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e37edb84f090321c2ab4b4aefc57f84a75b1b940/cves/2026/29xxx/CVE-2026-29205.json","https://github.com/Unclecheng-li/poc-lab/blob/b3a8fa7275a8368823f63eba88eb6e6b8e62a718/CVE-2026-29205%20cPanel2Shell-Scanner/README.md","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/df044812b70860d79ecaa4ed9deebd528d9595d4/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-29205.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a72c2d0c49169a0d402485a1b08b9cdd8f9a4630/2026/29xxx/CVE-2026-29205.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/39b22452fe579e54bd7f5c66d1416f8c94c190d0/content/posts/cve-2026-29205.md","https://github.com/Vu1nT0tal/yarb/blob/2853b83f9525211a3c7c25f2ab4e006505d500ad/archive/2026/2026-05-26.md","https://github.com/LING71671/open-reverselab/blob/f697fdee4ae14d089706ecf31543fe2bf4f47497/docs/llms.txt","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/e1686fb6d9ff590e56242cf0983cd0f4c2346da7/docs/2026/cPanel_and_WHM_cpdavd_%E4%BB%BB%E6%84%8F%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E8%AF%BB%E5%8F%96%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E_CVE-2026-29205.toml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/26d7afd7aa97d50454756aec5636fa553464ffd2/advisories/unreviewed/2026/05/GHSA-cc7w-h7g4-gq6p/GHSA-cc7w-h7g4-gq6p.json","https://github.com/BruceFeIix/picker/blob/bd44b76a25b814ea8e6e22c2ac0ba950c185bba4/archive/daily/2026/2026-05-23.md","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-29205"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0069.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0055","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0055.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-0257","title":"Palo Alto Networks PAN-OS GlobalProtect 认证绕过漏洞","description":"Palo Alto Networks PAN-OS 的 GlobalProtect 门户和网关存在身份验证绕过漏洞（CWE-565），源于对 Cookie 验证与完整性校验的缺失。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可利用特制的认证请求绕过安全限制，建立未经授权的 VPN 连接，从而访问内部网络资源。该漏洞影响 PAN-OS 10.2、11.1、11.2、12.1 等多个分支版本，不涉及 Panorama 和 Cloud NGFW。用户需升级至修复版本或禁用 Authentication Override 功能，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-0257"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-05-13T19:17:01.040","updated":"2026-06-17T10:10:37.953","remediation":"立即升级 PAN-OS 至修复版本：12.1.4-h6+/12.1.7+、11.2.4-h17+、11.1.4-h33+、10.2.7-h34+。同时禁用 GlobalProtect 的 Authentication Override 功能，并为 Cookie 加密配置独立证书，避免与 HTTPS 服务复用同一证书。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://security.paloaltonetworks.com/CVE-2026-0257","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-967325.html","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2026-0257","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/javascript/cves/2026/CVE-2026-0257.yaml","https://github.com/amnsecurity/CVE-2026-0257-GlobalProtect-Bypass","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1b6397ca00ebc515023ce73df945527011e5cc49/2026/CVE-2026-0257.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/7f6823bc066973da81d3ae0684f0bccdfe7fa7a4/2026/CVE-2026-0257.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/47b5b37845c422b41f7f77baee4751638de71f26/javascript/cves/2026/CVE-2026-0257.yaml","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/ca375d14d942ef42aac6a2bcdb572cb04d582145/doc/2026-06/%E3%80%90%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E3%80%91CVE-2026-0257%EF%BC%9APAN-OS%20%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%81%E7%BB%95%E8%BF%87%EF%BC%8C%E9%99%84%E6%9C%80%E6%96%B0%20IoC%20%E4%B8%8E%E6%8E%92%E6%9F%A5%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md","https://github.com/0xBlackash/CVE-2026-0257/blob/2fb0dd4128ba1eff8d40f606f97dea2cac9eb4e9/CVE-2026-0257.py","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2026-0257_9.yaml","https://github.com/HackTricks-wiki/hacktricks/blob/5afbe8bc711a6175de9d53730786b3ce06d8f726/src/pentesting-web/hacking-with-cookies/README.md","https://github.com/rtkwlf/wolf-tools/blob/fc4048e6c1b8c67363c98ba4eab964e839544a5d/threat-intelligence/globalprotect-cve-2026-0257-increase/globalprotect-cve-2026-0257-ioc-network.csv","https://github.com/Vu1nT0tal/yarb/blob/2853b83f9525211a3c7c25f2ab4e006505d500ad/archive/2026/2026-06-01.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9bf1bcd98df741ae892c1ba6b8127fb5da623fcc/cves/2026/0xxx/CVE-2026-0257.json","https://github.com/sfewer-r7/CVE-2026-0257","https://github.com/0xBlackash/CVE-2026-0257","https://github.com/tushargurav28/CVE-2026-0257","https://github.com/akashsingh0454/CVE-2026-0257-PoC","https://github.com/Mr-Robot-LP/CVE-2026-0257","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-0257"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0055.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0055.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0080","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0080.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-42945","title":"NGINX ngx_http_rewrite_module 堆缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"NGINX Plus 及 NGINX 开源版本的 ngx_http_rewrite_module 模块存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。当 rewrite 指令后跟随 rewrite、if 或 set 指令，且替换字符串中包含未命名 PCRE 捕获组及问号时，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过发送特制的 HTTP 请求触发堆缓冲区溢出，导致 Nginx 工作进程崩溃重启。在关闭或绕过 ASLR 防护的条件下，攻击者可进一步实现远程代码执行，CVSS 评分 9.2，危害等级严重。该漏洞影响多个 NGINX 版本，建议用户及时升级修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.2,"aliases":["CVE-2026-42945"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-05-13T16:16:50.190","updated":"2026-07-15T02:21:38.583","remediation":"立即升级至 NGINX Open Source 1.31.0 及以上版本，或 NGINX Plus 对应修复版本（R30 P1）。如无法立即升级，在 rewrite 配置中避免在捕获组 $1、$2 后接带问号的替换字符串，并移除所有使用匿名 PCRE 捕获的 rewrite 规则作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://my.f5.com/manage/s/article/K000161019","https://depthfirst.com/nginx-rift","https://github.com/DepthFirstDisclosures/Nginx-Rift","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:17417","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:17751","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:17752","https: