e,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0235.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0121","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0121.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-7256","title":"Zyxel WRE6505 Web 界面命令注入漏洞","description":"Zyxel WRE6505 v2 固件 V1.00(ABDV.3)C0 的 CGI 程序存在命令注入漏洞（CWE-78），LAN 中相邻攻击者可通过向设备 Web 管理界面发送特制的 HTTP 请求，在目标设备上以 root 权限执行任意操作系统命令。该设备已停产（EOL），Zyxel 不再提供安全更新，建议用户更换设备；临时缓解措施包括在网络层限制管理界面的访问来源 IP，避免将管理端口暴露至公网。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-7256"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-05-12T04:16:29.360","updated":"2026-06-17T11:02:05.663","remediation":"Zyxel WRE6505 v2 已停产（EOL），厂商不再发布安全补丁，建议立即更换为仍在支持周期内的 Zyxel 设备型号。在更换前，作为临时缓解措施：在路由器/防火墙上配置 ACL，仅允许受信任的 IP 地址访问设备管理界面（默认 80/443 端口），禁止将管理端口暴露至公网；同时将设备置于独立 VLAN 中，限制与核心网络的通信。若无需远程管理，可关闭设备的 Web 管理功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.zyxel.com/global/en/support/end-of-life","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a986b2f03c729ac57ae7d269a03d86211c579de0/cves/2026/7xxx/CVE-2026-7256.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2bdccdc718eb7ee3dca97ad4cd1a43e8a13111b5/2026/7xxx/CVE-2026-7256.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/f1d3db69525e35c34e256ac7316a1379e0f969b3/content/posts/cve-2026-7256.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2026-7256.md","https://github.com/3kz2501/3kz_blog/blob/78453fda61545f56ec9c1e2f8e5aa78adf2aa3c6/app/routes/posts/2026-05-12_CVE-2026-7256.mdx","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/Zyxel_WRE6505_Web_%E7%95%8C%E9%9D%A2%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E6%B3%A8%E5%85%A5%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E_CVE-2026-7256.toml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/834e72bf1d790a78930554cd283f772f3690fc67/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-7256.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2026-7256.json","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/194ebc78855b60e2ccd7fdd9fdb5de6934de4ed3/vulndb/vulns/nist/2026/07/VW-2026-7238.yaml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/68f861ef7056d26a199514826964f9781eeba15e/advisories/unreviewed/2026/05/GHSA-c7j6-24cr-x2rf/GHSA-c7j6-24cr-x2rf.json","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-7256"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0121.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0188","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0188.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-42208","title":"LiteLLM 代理 API 密钥验证中的预认证 SQL 注入漏洞","description":"LiteLLM 是一个 AI 网关代理服务器，用于以 OpenAI 兼容格式调用大模型 API。版本 1.81.16 至 1.83.7 之前，代理在验证 API 密钥时直接将攻击者通过 Authorization 头部传入的密钥值拼接到 SQL 查询字符串中，而非作为参数化查询的绑定变量传递。未经认证的远程攻击者可向任意 LLM API 路由（如 POST /chat/completions）发送精心构造的 Authorization 头部，经由代理的错误处理路径触发该漏洞，从而读取甚至修改代理数据库中的敏感数据，包括用户凭据和 API 密钥，进而获得对代理及所管理凭证的未授权访问权限。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-42208","GHSA-r75f-5x8p-qvmc","HWPOC-2026-034c822c"],"sources":["hwpoc","cve"],"published":"2026-05-08","updated":"2026-07-14","remediation":"立即将 LiteLLM 升级至 1.83.7 及以上版本，该版本已将用户输入作为参数化查询的绑定变量而非拼接到 SQL 字符串中修复此漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在 general_settings 中设置 disable_error_logs: true 阻断未认证输入到达脆弱查询的路径。该漏洞已被 CISA KEV 收录并检测到在野利用，应优先处理。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm/security/advisories/GHSA-r75f-5x8p-qvmc","https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm/releases/tag/v1.83.7-stable","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-42208","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-42208","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2026-42208"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0188.toml"}]